# PIR Motion Detection Project

## Aim
To detect human movement using a PIR sensor.

## Components Required
- Raspberry Pi 4 Model B
- PIR Motion Sensor
- Red LED
- Buzzer
- Jumper Wires

## Programming Language
Python

## Description
This project detects motion using a PIR sensor and activates an LED and buzzer as an alert.

## Result
Motion is detected and an alert is generated.
